WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.601
Muffy is my dog.

2
00:00:03.602 --> 00:00:06.584
She is furry and white.

3
00:00:06.585 --> 00:00:10.530
"How cute!"

4
00:00:10.531 --> 00:00:17.078
Muffy likes to play all around the house.

5
00:00:17.079 --> 00:00:22.123
"Don’t go outside again!"

6
00:00:22.124 --> 00:00:26.499
On Monday, I opened the door for my friend.

7
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:34.520
"Stop, Muffy!" I said, but Muffy ran away.

8
00:00:34.521 --> 00:00:38.872
"Mom, Muffy is gone!" I said.

9
00:00:38.873 --> 00:00:43.735
Mom thought Muffy was at the park.

10
00:00:43.736 --> 00:00:45.568
We went to the park.

11
00:00:45.569 --> 00:00:49.878
But Muffy was not at the park.

12
00:00:49.879 --> 00:00:53.503
Sometimes Muffy played with Mr. Smith.

13
00:00:53.504 --> 00:00:58.984
But Muffy was not at Mr. Smith’s house.

14
00:00:58.985 --> 00:01:01.703
Mom called the animal shelter.

15
00:01:01.704 --> 00:01:06.616
But Muffy was not there either.

16
00:01:06.617 --> 00:01:10.460
"Muffy is really gone!" I said. Mom

17
00:01:10.461 --> 00:01:15.352
and I made a poster together. We

18
00:01:15.353 --> 00:01:19.632
put Muffy’s picture on the poster. We

19
00:01:19.633 --> 00:01:23.154
put the posters everywhere. We

20
00:01:23.155 --> 00:01:28.146
put a poster in the grocery store too. It

21
00:01:28.147 --> 00:01:31.610
was Tuesday, then it was Wednesday. No

22
00:01:31.611 --> 00:01:34.880
one called about Muffy. On

23
00:01:34.881 --> 00:01:40.681
Thursday the phone rang. Ring ring !

24
00:01:40.682 --> 00:01:43.178
"Hello, I saw the poster.

25
00:01:43.179 --> 00:01:45.667
I have your dog."

26
00:01:45.668 --> 00:01:49.766
On Friday, a man drove a car to our house.

27
00:01:49.767 --> 00:01:52.544
Muffy was in the car.

28
00:01:52.545 --> 00:01:56.493
"Mom, there is Muffy!" I said.

29
00:01:56.494 --> 00:01:58.235
I’m so happy.

30
00:01:58.236 --> 00:02:00.262
Muffy is home!

31
00:02:00.263 --> 00:02:06.776
"Muffy, don’t run away again!"

